Share label.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Ещё один передний порт USB 2.0 Type-A без обозначения PowerShare.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"front.usbc.gen2.powershare\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"front.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Front USB 3.1 Gen 2 Type-C · PowerShare\",\n        \"ru\": \"Передний USB 3.1 Gen 2 Type-C · PowerShare\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One front USB 3.1 Gen 2 Type-C port with PowerShare, as documented by Dell.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один передний порт USB 3.1 Gen 2 Type-C с PowerShare согласно документации Dell.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"front.usb3.gen1\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"front.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Front USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A port\",\n        \"ru\": \"Передний порт USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One front USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A port.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один передний порт USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"chassis.rear_panel\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear I/O and chassis interface region\",\n        \"ru\": \"Зона задних разъёмов и интерфейсов корпуса\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"mechanical_io\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"Semantic grouping for Dell-documented rear ports, indicators, openings and chassis locks. Individual coordinates and port module combinations are not measured.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Смысловая группа задних портов, индикаторов, отверстий и замков по документации Dell. Координаты и комбинации модулей не измерены.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.line_out\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear line-out audio jack\",\n        \"ru\": \"Задний аудиовыход Line-out\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One rear line-out connector listed by Dell.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один задний аудиовыход Line-out по документации Dell.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.serial.optional\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Optional serial port module\",\n        \"ru\": \"Опциональный модуль последовательного порта\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"unknown\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"Optional rear serial port; presence depends on the ordered I/O configuration.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Опциональный задний последовательный порт; наличие зависит от заказанной конфигурации I/O.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.video_module.optional\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Optional third-video-output module · one configured option\",\n        \"ru\": \"Модуль опционального третьего видеовыхода · один вариант по комплектации\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"unknown\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"Dell documents optional HDMI 2.0b, DisplayPort, VGA or USB-C DisplayPort Alt Mode module options. These are alternatives, not four simultaneous ports.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Dell документирует опциональные модули HDMI 2.0b, DisplayPort, VGA или USB-C DisplayPort Alt Mode. Это альтернативы, а не четыре одновременно установленных порта.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.displayport.1\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear DisplayPort 1\",\n        \"ru\": \"Задний DisplayPort 1\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of two standard rear DisplayPort outputs listed by Dell.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один из двух штатных задних выходов DisplayPort по документации Dell.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.displayport.2\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear DisplayPort 2\",\n        \"ru\": \"Задний DisplayPort 2\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of two standard rear DisplayPort outputs listed by Dell.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один из двух штатных задних выходов DisplayPort по документации Dell.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.usb3.gen1.1\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear USB 3.1 Gen 1 port 1\",\n        \"ru\": \"Задний USB 3.1 Gen 1 порт 1\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of four rear USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A ports.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один из четырёх задних портов USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.usb3.gen1.2\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear USB 3.1 Gen 1 port 2\",\n        \"ru\": \"Задний USB 3.1 Gen 1 порт 2\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of four rear USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A ports.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один из четырёх задних портов USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.usb3.gen1.3\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear USB 3.1 Gen 1 port 3\",\n        \"ru\": \"Задний USB 3.1 Gen 1 порт 3\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of four rear USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A ports.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один из четырёх задних портов USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.usb3.gen1.4\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear USB 3.1 Gen 1 port 4\",\n        \"ru\": \"Задний USB 3.1 Gen 1 порт 4\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of four rear USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A ports.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один из четырёх задних портов USB 3.1 Gen 1 Type-A.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.usb2.smartpoweron.1\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear USB 2.0 SmartPower On port 1\",\n        \"ru\": \"Задний USB 2.0 SmartPower On порт 1\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of two rear USB 2.0 SmartPower On ports.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один из двух задних портов USB 2.0 SmartPower On.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.usb2.smartpoweron.2\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear USB 2.0 SmartPower On port 2\",\n        \"ru\": \"Задний USB 2.0 SmartPower On порт 2\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"external_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of two rear USB 2.0 SmartPower On ports.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один из двух задних портов USB 2.0 SmartPower On.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.rj45\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"RJ-45 Gigabit Ethernet port\",\n        \"ru\": \"Порт Gigabit Ethernet RJ-45\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"network_port\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One rear RJ-45 Ethernet connector; exact network controller and PHY are not identified here.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Один задний разъём Ethernet RJ-45; конкретный сетевой контроллер и PHY здесь не определяются.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.expansion_opening.1\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Expansion-card rear opening 1\",\n        \"ru\": \"Заднее окно платы расширения 1\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"mechanical_io\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of four rear expansion-card openings; card occupancy is unknown.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Одно из четырёх задних окон плат расширения; наличие плат неизвестно.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.expansion_opening.2\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Expansion-card rear opening 2\",\n        \"ru\": \"Заднее окно платы расширения 2\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"mechanical_io\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of four rear expansion-card openings; card occupancy is unknown.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Одно из четырёх задних окон плат расширения; наличие плат неизвестно.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.expansion_opening.3\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Expansion-card rear opening 3\",\n        \"ru\": \"Заднее окно платы расширения 3\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"mechanical_io\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of four rear expansion-card openings; card occupancy is unknown.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Одно из четырёх задних окон плат расширения; наличие плат неизвестно.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.expansion_opening.4\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Expansion-card rear opening 4\",\n        \"ru\": \"Заднее окно платы расширения 4\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"mechanical_io\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"One of four rear expansion-card openings; card occupancy is unknown.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Одно из четырёх задних окон плат расширения; наличие плат неизвестно.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.psu_inlet\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"AC power inlet on PSU\",\n        \"ru\": \"Сетевой вход питания блока питания\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"power_interface\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"Rear AC inlet on the PSU enclosure. Exact PSU model and inlet module are unknown.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Задний сетевой вход на корпусе БП. Точная модель БП и узел входа неизвестны.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.antenna.1.optional\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Optional external antenna connector 1\",\n        \"ru\": \"Опциональный разъём внешней антенны 1\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"wireless_interface\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"unknown\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"Optional external antenna connection for a compatible wireless configuration.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Опциональное подключение внешней антенны для совместимой беспроводной конфигурации.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.antenna.2.optional\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Optional external antenna connector 2\",\n        \"ru\": \"Опциональный разъём внешней антенны 2\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"wireless_interface\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"unknown\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"Optional external antenna connection for a compatible wireless configuration.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Опциональное подключение внешней антенны для совместимой беспроводной конфигурации.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.psu_diagnostic_led\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"PSU diagnostic indicator\",\n        \"ru\": \"Диагностический индикатор БП\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"status_indicator\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"Power-supply diagnostic light documented on the rear panel; diagnostic behavior is not simulated.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Диагностический индикатор блока питания на задней панели; поведение индикации не симулируется.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.kensington_slot\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Kensington security slot\",\n        \"ru\": \"Слот безопасности Kensington\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"mechanical_io\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"Chassis anti-theft cable attachment point.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Точка крепления противоугонного троса к корпусу.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.padlock_loop\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Padlock loop\",\n        \"ru\": \"Петля для навесного замка\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"mechanical_io\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"Chassis padlock loop identified in Dell's rear-view legend.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Петля корпуса для навесного замка по схеме задней панели Dell.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"rear.service_tag\",\n      \"parent_id\": \"rear.io_region\",\n      \"name\": {\n        \"en\": \"Service Tag label location\",\n        \"ru\": \"Место наклейки Service Tag\"\n      },\n      \"category\": \"identity_marker\",\n      \"evidence_status\": \"manufacturer_data\",\n      \"geometry_status\": \"logical_only\",\n      \"source_ids\": [\n        \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n        \"src.dell.5060.ports\"\n      ],\n      \"description\": {\n        \"en\": \"Service Tag location on the chassis. No real service-tag value is stored in this family package.\",\n        \"ru\": \"Место размещения Service Tag на корпусе. Реальное значение сервисного тега в пакете семейства не хранится.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n","sources.json":"{\n  \"schema_version\": \"0.1.0\",\n  \"device_model_id\": \"pc.dell.optiplex-5060-tower.family\",\n  \"sources\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.service\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower Service Manual\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_service_manual\",\n      \"url\": \"https://dl.dell.com/topicspdf/optiplex-5060-desktop_service-manual8_en-us.pdf\",\n      \"locator\": \"Tower motherboard map, fastener table, removal and installation procedures; printed pages 1 and 15–69\",\n      \"notes\": \"Primary source for serviceable assemblies and listed fastener types/counts. It does not identify one exact retail configuration or provide full CAD geometry.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.setup\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower support · Manuals and specifications\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_setup_guide\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/product-details/en-us/product/optiplex-5060-desktop/resources/manuals\",\n      \"locator\": \"Tower physical characteristics\",\n      \"notes\": \"Family-level chassis dimensions and mass. These values constrain the outer envelope, not internal component coordinates.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.boardlayout\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower motherboard layout\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_service_manual_web\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_service_manual/tower-motherboard-layout?guid=guid-fdd68959-9fc2-4808-921a-11d712a6b730&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"Tower motherboard layout, numbered callouts 1–26\",\n      \"notes\": \"Official Dell board map. Callouts identify connector positions and expansion-slot functions; they do not establish a measured PCB coordinate system or installed optional modules.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.board_removal\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower system board removal\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_service_procedure\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_service_manual/Removing-system-board?guid=guid-4619c874-96c4-4bf3-9e6e-cdc300d69ca1&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"Removing system board — prerequisite removal list, cable disconnection and board fasteners\",\n      \"notes\": \"Manufacturer sequence used for the partial board-removal workflow. Optional components are only removed when fitted; this is not a universal teardown of every possible configuration.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.processors\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower processor specifications\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_setup_specification\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_setup_and_specs/processor?guid=guid-b6e22f5e-0a6e-434f-b097-e21f7ea9e9b4&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"Supported 8th-generation Intel processor option table\",\n      \"notes\": \"Supported CPU options only; no particular processor is asserted as installed. A service-manual processor table differs on some thermal-power values, so the package records the setup/specification table and flags this source discrepancy.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.memory\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower memory specifications\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_setup_specification\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_setup_and_specs/memory?guid=guid-18225fae-5925-40fc-b98e-a33786b03be1&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"Memory type, speed, slot count and maximum capacity\",\n      \"notes\": \"Manufacturer platform capability; fitted DIMM count, capacity and part numbers remain unknown.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.storage\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower storage specifications\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_setup_specification\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_setup_and_specs/storage?guid=guid-9f98af2f-4c67-48fb-a236-8260a915d407&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"M.2 SSD, SATA drive options, supported form factors and storage combinations\",\n      \"notes\": \"Supported storage configurations, not proof of installed drive population.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.board_connectors\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower system-board connectors\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_setup_specification\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_setup_and_specs/system-board-connectors?guid=guid-c4437ab5-83cf-4c2e-a842-88de441bfc51&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"M.2, SATA, PCIe and WLAN connector table\",\n      \"notes\": \"Manufacturer connector capability and generation information; no cable path or fitted-device state is implied.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.ports\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower ports and connectors\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_setup_specification\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_setup_and_specs/ports-and-connectors?guid=guid-2f34b1fb-c81e-4e2c-9311-f801dd11fb9b&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"Front and rear external ports and connector counts\",\n      \"notes\": \"External I/O support and count; optional module choices vary by order configuration.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.power\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower power supply specifications\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_setup_specification\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_setup_and_specs/power-supply?guid=guid-d91d1b07-1ab0-4633-8dd8-9ef84459bf19&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"260 W PSU variants and AC input characteristics\",\n      \"notes\": \"Two platform PSU variants are listed. The installed PSU manufacturer, Dell part number, efficiency option and revision remain unknown.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.screw_table\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower screw-size list\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_service_manual_web\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_service_manual/screw-size-list?guid=guid-a77fcea9-e6c9-4fd8-bc2b-2bedbc1f0d71&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"Tower screw-size and quantity table\",\n      \"notes\": \"Documents listed screw types and quantities. Table sum must not be treated as installed screw count in every build.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.heatsink\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower heatsink removal\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_service_procedure\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_service_manual/removing-heat-sink?guid=guid-5187dca8-063c-4317-a83f-faeefbc6c82d&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"Loosen four captive heatsink screws in the numbered 1–4 sequence\",\n      \"notes\": \"Supports the documented fastener group and screw-release order; no torque value or exact screw coordinates are stated.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.cpu_removal\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower processor removal\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_service_procedure\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_service_manual/removing-processor?guid=guid-2a1085f3-2318-4253-b9e1-61e799a99d84&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"Release socket lever and processor cover after heatsink removal\",\n      \"notes\": \"Manufacturer warning about delicate socket contacts; no processor is selected for this family-level package.\",\n      \"access_date\": \"2026-11-26\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"src.dell.5060.system_fan\",\n      \"title\": \"Dell OptiPlex 5060 Tower system fan removal\",\n      \"publisher\": \"Dell Technologies\",\n      \"source_type\": \"manufacturer_service_procedure\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.dell.com/support/manuals/en-us/optiplex-5060-desktop/optiplex_5060_mt_service_manual/removing-system-fan?guid=guid-e43132eb-d02f-49d0-bb6e-2a1f13e8964b&lang=en-us\",\n      \"locator\": \"Disconnect intrusion-switch and fan cables; release rubber grommets\